                    <div class="featured-card-glow"></div>
                    <div class="featured-card-content">
                        <div class="featured-card-icon">🔮</div>
                        <div class="featured-card-text">
                            <div class="featured-badge">编辑精选 · 第 5 本</div>
                            <h4 class="featured-card-title">《必然》</h4>
                            <p class="featured-card-author">凯文·凯利 · 2016</p>
                            <p class="featured-card-desc">凯文·凯利基于 30 年科技观察写就的前瞻之作。书中精准预测了未来 30 年将塑造我们生活的 12 种技术力量:从人工智能、增强现实到追踪与分享。本书是理解"科技必然"的最佳入门,也是创业者、产品经理与所有关注未来人士的必读书目,被译为 20 多种语言全球发行。</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="featured-card-cta">
                            阅读 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <a href="wuxian-youxi.html" class="featured-card cube-card" data-num="06">
                    <div class="featured-card-num">06</div>
                    <div class="featured-card-glow"></div>
                    <div class="featured-card-content">
                        <div class="featured-card-icon">♾️</div>
                        <div class="featured-card-text">
                            <div class="featured-badge">编辑精选 · 第 6 本</div>
                            <h4 class="featured-card-title">《无限游戏》</h4>
                            <p class="featured-card-author">西蒙·斯涅克 · 2019</p>
                            <p class="featured-card-desc">西蒙·斯涅克继《Start With Why》之后的又一力作,被 Netflix 创始人里德·哈斯廷斯誉为"重新定义商业的书"。本书提出一个深邃洞见:商业、人生、婚姻都可分为"有限游戏"和"无限游戏",真正的领导者不追求赢,而是建立让游戏永远继续下去的愿景与信任。</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="featured-card-cta">
                            阅读 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <a href="dan-koe.html" class="featured-card cube-card" data-num="07">
                    <div class="featured-card-num">07</div>
                    <div class="featured-card-glow"></div>
                    <div class="featured-card-content">
                        <div class="featured-card-icon">🚀</div>
                        <div class="featured-card-text">
                            <div class="featured-badge">编辑精选 · 第 7 本</div>
                            <h4 class="featured-card-title">《Dan Koe》</h4>
                            <p class="featured-card-author">Dan Koe · 当代</p>
                            <p class="featured-card-desc">Dan Koe 用自身实践证明了:在数字时代,一个人就是一家公司。本书系统阐述了通过内容创作、精准定位与产品化思维,普通人也能建立可持续的事业。Dan Koe 拥有数百万粉丝,他的方法论影响了全球新一代独立创业者,成为数字游民时代的个人品牌圣经。</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="featured-card-cta">
                            阅读 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                        </span>
                    </div>
