                <a href="shikong.html" class="featured-card cube-card" data-num="08">
                    <div class="featured-card-num">08</div>
                    <div class="featured-card-glow"></div>
                    <div class="featured-card-content">
                        <div class="featured-card-icon">⏰</div>
                        <div class="featured-card-text">
                            <div class="featured-badge">编辑精选 · 第 8 本</div>
                            <h4 class="featured-card-title">《时间》</h4>
                            <p class="featured-card-author">Eva Hoffman · 当代</p>
                            <p class="featured-card-desc">在这个一切都被加速的时代,我们如何重新理解时间?本书从哲学、心理学、神经科学多角度,探讨时间感知的本质。揭示了一个反直觉的真相:我们对时间的所有焦虑,都源于"时间不够"的幻觉。本书引导我们与时间建立更健康的关系,活在每一个不被错过的当下。</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="featured-card-cta">
                            阅读 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </a>
